    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin is a lightweight yet powerful date and time picker designed for popular form builder plugins.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>This plugin will add new type of field under <code>Standrad Fields</code> as <code>Date Time</code>. </li>\n<li>Simply drag <code>Date-Time</code> field into the form.</li>\n<li>You can also add custom date time format under <code>Date Time Field</code> tab.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload and unzip <code>date-time-field-for-forms.zip</code> to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added WPForms and Contact Form 7</li>\n<li>Added more options</li>\n<li>Added dashboard</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added a Date Time field for Gravity form</li>\n<li>Added an option to add custom date time format</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
